{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用示例 [2,7,9,3,1] 演示动态规划：处理第 i 间房时，只需比较“不偷它的历史最优值”和“偷它后得到的前两间最优值加当前金额”。动画逐步标出两种选择及 dp 状态，最终 dp[5] = 12，对应偷窃第 1、3、5 间房。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>打家劫舍可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}h1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.intro{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.formula{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#252526;font-size:12px}.mono,.amount,.dp-value,.answer{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}section{margin-top:8px}.section-label{margin-bottom:6px;color:#9cdcfe;font-size:10px}.houses,.dp-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.house,.dp-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;text-align:center;transition:.35s}.house-index,.dp-index{margin-bottom:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.amount{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#dcdcaa}.house-status{min-height:12px;margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.house.current,.dp-cell.current{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.house.current .amount,.house.current .house-index,.house.current .house-status,.dp-cell.current .dp-index,.dp-cell.current .dp-value{color:#fff}.house.selected{border-color:#3794ff;background:#163a55}.dp-cell.pending .dp-value{color:#8d8d8d}.dp-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#ce9178}.decision{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}.step-title{color:#d4d4d4;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:8px}.choice{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;font-size:12px}.choice.winner{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.choice-name{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}.choice-value{font-size:13px}.reason{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;font-size:12px}.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}.dot{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:#3c3c3c}.dot.on{background:#3794ff}.result{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;font-size:12px}.answer{color:#3794ff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}\n.houses .house{width:76px;min-height:76px}.house-index{white-space:nowrap}.house-status{line-height:1.4}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>相邻房屋不能同时偷</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">示例输入：<span class=\"mono\">[2, 7, 9, 3, 1]</span>。从左到右处理房屋，并保存每个前缀能取得的最高金额。</p>\n  <div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"mono\">dp[i] = max(dp[i−1], dp[i−2] + 当前金额)</span><br>左项表示不偷当前房，右项表示偷当前房，因此必须接在前两间房的最优结果之后。</div>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"section-label\">房屋与金额</div>\n    <div class=\"houses\" id=\"houses\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"section-label\">前 i 间房的最高金额</div>\n    <div class=\"dp-row\" id=\"dpRow\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"decision\">\n    <div class=\"step-title\" id=\"stepTitle\"></div>\n    <div class=\"choices\">\n      <div class=\"choice\" id=\"skipChoice\">\n        <div class=\"choice-name\">不偷当前房</div>\n        <div class=\"choice-value\" id=\"skipValue\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"choice\" id=\"takeChoice\">\n        <div class=\"choice-name\">偷当前房</div>\n        <div class=\"choice-value\" id=\"takeValue\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reason\" id=\"reason\"></div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"result\">最终最高金额：<span class=\"answer\">12</span><br>一种最优选择是第 <span class=\"mono\">1、3、5</span> 间房，金额为 <span class=\"mono\">2 + 9 + 1 = 12</span>。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const money = [2, 7, 9, 3, 1];\n  const dp = [0, 2, 7, 11, 11, 12];\n  const chosen = [[], [1], [2], [1,3], [1,3], [1,3,5]];\n  const houses = document.getElementById('houses');\n  const dpRow = document.getElementById('dpRow');\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n\n  money.forEach((value, i) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'house';\n    cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"house-index\">第 ' + (i + 1) + ' 间</div><div class=\"amount\">' + value + '</div><div class=\"house-status\">等待处理</div>';\n    houses.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n\n  dp.forEach((value, i) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'dp-cell pending';\n    cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"dp-index\">dp[' + i + ']</div><div class=\"dp-value\">?</div>';\n    dpRow.appendChild(cell);\n    const dot = document.createElement('div');\n    dot.className = 'dot';\n    progress.appendChild(dot);\n  });\n\n  const houseCells = [...houses.children];\n  const dpCells = [...dpRow.children];\n  const dots = [...progress.children];\n  const title = document.getElementById('stepTitle');\n  const skipChoice = document.getElementById('skipChoice');\n  const takeChoice = document.getElementById('takeChoice');\n  const skipValue = document.getElementById('skipValue');\n  const takeValue = document.getElementById('takeValue');\n  const reason = document.getElementById('reason');\n  let step = 0;\n\n  function render(i) {\n    houseCells.forEach((cell, index) => {\n      cell.className = 'house';\n      cell.querySelector('.house-status').textContent = index < i - 1 ? '已处理' : '等待处理';\n      if (i > 0 && chosen[i].includes(index + 1)) {\n        cell.classList.add('selected');\n        cell.querySelector('.house-status').textContent = '当前最优中选取';\n      }\n      if (index === i - 1) {\n        cell.classList.add('current');\n        cell.querySelector('.house-status').textContent = '正在决策';\n      }\n    });\n\n    dpCells.forEach((cell, index) => {\n      cell.className = 'dp-cell' + (index > i ? ' pending' : '');\n      cell.querySelector('.dp-value').textContent = index <= i ? dp[index] : '?';\n      if (index === i) cell.classList.add('current');\n    });\n    dots.forEach((dot, index) => dot.className = 'dot' + (index <= i ? ' on' : ''));\n\n    skipChoice.className = 'choice';\n    takeChoice.className = 'choice';\n    if (i === 0) {\n      title.textContent = '起点：还没有处理任何房屋';\n      skipValue.textContent = '金额 = 0';\n      takeValue.textContent = '暂无房屋';\n      skipChoice.classList.add('winner');\n      reason.textContent = '空前缀的最高金额为 0，它是后续状态的起点。';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const skip = dp[i - 1];\n    const base = i >= 2 ? dp[i - 2] : 0;\n    const take = base + money[i - 1];\n    title.textContent = '处理第 ' + i + ' 间房（金额 ' + money[i - 1] + '）';\n    skipValue.textContent = 'dp[' + (i - 1) + '] = ' + skip;\n    takeValue.textContent = 'dp[' + Math.max(0, i - 2) + '] + ' + money[i - 1] + ' = ' + take;\n    if (take > skip) takeChoice.classList.add('winner');\n    else skipChoice.classList.add('winner');\n    reason.textContent = take > skip\n      ? '偷当前房更优：' + take + ' > ' + skip + '，所以 dp[' + i + '] = ' + dp[i] + '。'\n      : '不偷当前房更优或相同：' + skip + ' ≥ ' + take + '，所以沿用 dp[' + (i - 1) + '] = ' + dp[i] + '。';\n  }\n\n  render(step);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    step = (step + 1) % 6;\n    render(step);\n  }, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
